{"id":1111302,"name":"アイゴ・取り調べⅡ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"アイゴ・取り調べⅡ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1111302]}],"trial":{"trial_id":111302,"stage":"段階2","unlock_time":"2026-05-07 14:00:00","diary1":"アイゴは突然「脱獄」し、意味不明なメモを残した。あなたは手掛かりを辿ってニューシティの地下オークション場を突き止めたが、そこで予期せぬ出来事が起こった。","diary2":"アイゴの長寿体質は、実のところ狂瞳病と古い蠱毒が体内でかろうじてバランスを保っている結果である。だが今、その身体は崩壊の危機に瀕している。「帰源散」を飲んだことでまるで爆弾に火がついたかのように、彼女の意識は深淵へと引きずり込まれてしまった。あなたは彼女を呼び覚まさなければならない。\n　永遠の若さを保つ代償は、終わりなく続く肉体の苦痛だ。毒でもって毒を抑えることこそ、彼女が見つけ出した唯一の方法だったのだ。","evidence":[{"ID":260907,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260908,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211302022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dia